@startuml
title Incident lifecycle (State pattern)

[*] --> Reported : setState(new ReportedState)
Reported --> Dispatched : advance()
Dispatched --> Contained : advance()
Contained --> Resolved : advance()
Resolved --> Resolved : advance() rejected, returns false

note right of Resolved
  Terminal state.
  ResolvedState::advance() prints an
  error and returns false.
end note

note bottom of Dispatched
  Every transition goes through
  Incident::setState(), which calls notify()
end note
@enduml
